            "Destructive inspections at the handling unit level.",
            "Improved stock management with EWM elements like warehouse numbers, storage types, and bins."
          ],
          "Stock Types and Transactions": "Introduction of new EWM stock types (e.g., Q1, B1, S1) and their corresponding storage locations. Enhanced stock monitoring through transactions like MMBE, SCWM/MON, and MD04."
